<section style="background:#080808;min-height:60vh;padding:4rem 0;">
  <div class="page-content">

    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      <div style="height:1px;width:32px;background:#C9A84C;"></div>
      <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;">Legal</span>
    </div>

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
    <p>The 00s Version ("we", "us", "our") operates the e-commerce store at the00sversion.com. We are the data controller for your personal information.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information you provide directly when placing an order, including your name, email address, shipping address, and payment details. Payment information is processed securely by Shopify Payments — we do not store card numbers.</p>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Fulfil and ship your orders</li>
      <li>Send order confirmation and shipping notifications</li>
      <li>Respond to customer service enquiries</li>
      <li>Improve our products and services</li>
      <li>Send marketing emails (only with your consent)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
    <p>We share your shipping information with our fulfilment partner (CJ Dropshipping) solely to ship your order. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

    <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use essential cookies to keep your cart working and remember your preferences. See our <a href="/pages/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>6. Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <p>If you are in the EU or UK you have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. Contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@the00sversion.com">privacy@the00sversion.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain order data for 7 years as required by EU tax law. You may request deletion of marketing data at any time.</p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:privacy@the00sversion.com">privacy@the00sversion.com</a>.</p>

  </div>
</section>

